{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c491","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a1833c-5db9-7c13-8ce4-12f397c1cfa6"},"sequence":163,"recorded_at":1780531400000321,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a1833c-5f91-7a83-9a6c-d885674ebe8f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"command_id":"01a1833c-5f91-7a83-9a6c-d885674ebe8f","event":{"chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-1-1\",\n  \"command\": \"ls app/folio app/leer app/narration 2>&1; echo ---; ls data/books/oz/ 2>&1 | head -20; echo ---; cat package.json | head -60; echo ---; cat BUILT_DURING_HACKATHON.md 2>&1 | tail -20\",\n  \"description\": \"List folio, leer, narration dirs\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"ls: cannot access 'app/narration': No such file or directory\\napp/folio:\\nchrome.tsx\\ncopy-gates.test.ts\\ndev-panel.tsx\\nfigure-placement.test.ts\\nfigure-placement.ts\\nhelpers.ts\\nimage-pane.tsx\\ninline-figures.tsx\\nlightbox.tsx\\nmusic-style-control.test.ts\\nmusic-style-control.tsx\\npanels-modal.tsx\\npanels.test.ts\\npanels.ts\\npicture-copy.tsx\\nscroll-turn.test.ts\\nscroll-turn.ts\\nuse-pictures.test.tsx\\nuse-pictures.ts\\nvault.tsx\\n\\napp/leer:\\n[sceneId]\\nlayout.tsx\\nscene-page.tsx\\n---\\nanalysis.json\\nbook.json\\nmusic-clusters.json\\nnarration.json\\nscenes.json\\n---\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"lectoria-meta\\\",\\n  \\\"private\\\": true,\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\",\\n  \\\"engines\\\": {\\n    \\\"node\\\": \\\"22.x\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"dev\\\": \\\"next dev\\\",\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"next build\\\",\\n    \\\"build:book\\\": \\\"tsx pipeline/build.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"build:music\\\": \\\"tsx pipeline/labels-to-manifest.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"clean:epub\\\": \\\"tsx pipeline/clean-epub.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"start\\\": \\\"next start\\\",\\n    \\\"typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc --noEmit\\\",\\n    \\\"test\\\": \\\"vitest run\\\",\\n    \\\"check:secrets\\\": \\\"node scripts/check-secrets.mjs\\\",\\n    \\\"check:isolation\\\": \\\"node scripts/check-isolation.mjs\\\",\\n    \\\"check:size\\\": \\\"node scripts/check-file-size.mjs\\\",\\n    \\\"prepare\\\": \\\"git rev-parse --git-dir >/dev/null 2>&1 && git config core.hooksPath .githooks || true\\\",\\n    \\\"test:hooks\\\": \\\"node --test scripts/*.test.mjs\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@vercel/blob\\\": \\\"2.8.2\\\",\\n    \\\"fflate\\\": \\\"0.8.3\\\",\\n    \\\"modal\\\": \\\"0.11.1\\\",\\n    \\\"next\\\": \\\"16.4.3\\\",\\n    \\\"react\\\": \\\"19.3.1\\\",\\n    \\\"react-dom\\\": \\\"19.3.1\\\",\\n    \\\"server-only\\\": \\\"0.0.1\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@types/jsdom\\\": \\\"30.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/node\\\": \\\"22.20.5\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/react\\\": \\\"19.3.0\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/react-dom\\\": \\\"19.3.0\\\",\\n    \\\"jsdom\\\": \\\"30.1.3\\\",\\n    \\\"tsx\\\": \\\"^4.19.2\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"5.9.3\\\",\\n    \\\"vitest\\\": \\\"5.0.5\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"overrides\\\": {\\n    \\\"zod\\\": \\\"^4.6.6\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n---\\n| 2026-10-28 | 12: music session | Pure music session module behind the reader plus one scope-rank-draw path, no behavior change | Muse Code (Standard) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 19: step freshness | One freshness rule per pipeline step with dry run, Oz stamp reused | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 16: folio reader | Folio redesign from the margin prototype: top line, resizable image pane, reading column, Picture Vault, bottom band, sticker styles, hidden dev view, warm copy pass | Muse Code (Standard; Contributor for one small fix) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 27: light default | Light-first theme with stored choice kept, plus the music-style control isolated in one component and CSS file | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 25: rain ambience | Rain button cycling drizzle, moderate and storm CC0 loops with Web Audio crossfades, separate saved volume, master mute | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 25b: rain still | Rain button frameless and still: animates only on hover and click, glow on the icon, focus ring on keyboard focus only | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 36: music still + title slot | Orchestra, Piano and Chopin buttons frameless and still (hover and one-shot pop only); fixed 300 px title slot with marquee so player icons never move | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 30: resplit null-final | Null re-classified part keeps the scene whole with a reclassify_failures entry, usage still counted | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 32: pictures placement | Figure rules in folio with tests, one picture copy source, theme key in app/theme | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 20: home | Home page with Oz hero, browser-side EPUB parsing, free/BYOK upload flow | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 34: music mode cycle | One ordered mode list and modeAdvanced intent behind the style control, persisted Chopin mode, same visuals | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 20b: byok label | Home BYOK label reads \\\"Bring your own key!\\\" | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 36: wheel turn | Wheel and trackpad turn pages at column edges with an inertia lock, Space/Page keys scroll then turn, read-on cue under text pages | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 39: music session transition | One transition path for music mode intents, behavior unchanged | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 42: popover cover | Picture this popover attaches when the text view mounts, fixing first scenes | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 37: music prefs owner | One prefs store with merging partial updates; early volume or mute changes no longer clobber the saved style and Chopin mode | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 24: cleaning | Book cleaning layer: EPUB spine reader, deterministic front/back-matter rules, one cheap Muse judge call for ambiguous sections, removal report, clean:epub CLI | Muse Code (Standard design; Contributor implementation) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 38: heading focus | Scene heading never shows a focus ring, opt-in wheel/keyboard scroll e2e | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 31: skin seam | data-skin attribute with a default token layer and a named icon registry, zero visual change | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 40: chapter narration | Kokoro af_heart chapter mp3s with sentence timings on Modal, content-keyed cache, pipeline step, server adapters, contract | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 5181,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1296,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true,"kind":"output","task_id":"01a1833c-87c3-7e92-97c8-4135b1fbfac4"},"kind":"task_lifecycle","run_stream":{"id":"01a1833c-5f91-7a83-9a6c-d885674ebe8f","kind":"run"},"task_id":"01a1833c-87c3-7e92-97c8-4135b1fbfac4","task_stream":{"id":"01a1833c-87c3-7e92-97c8-4135b1fbfac4","kind":"task"}}}
